1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Die?!</b></font>

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:09,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>How come becoming one
with nature means dying?</b></font>

3
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:13,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Gamakichi, what's with the dying?!</b></font>

4
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:14,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Don't make such weird analogies!</b></font>

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:16,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>But...</b></font>

6
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:22,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Relax. You're not actually
going to die, Naruto-boy.</b></font>

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Then what?</b></font>

8
00:00:24,630 --> 00:00:27,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Just wait 'til I'm finished...</b></font>

9
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:29,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I'll explain it stepwise.</b></font>

10
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:36,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Absorbing Nature Energy...</b></font>

11
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:38,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>It means the ability to
sense it around you</b></font>

12
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:41,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>and draw it into yourself.</b></font>

13
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:45,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>In addition,
by becoming one with nature,</b></font>

14
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:48,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>you also gain full control
over the Nature Energy</b></font>

15
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:51,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>entering and leaving your body.</b></font>

16
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:56,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Practically speaking,
in terms of your training...</b></font>

17
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Yeah, yeah?</b></font>

18
00:00:58,570 --> 00:00:59,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Sit still.</b></font>

19
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:00,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Huh?</b></font>

20
00:01:00,930 --> 00:01:03,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>It means sit still!</b></font>

21
00:01:03,770 --> 00:01:06,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>When you cease your flow
of animal instincts</b></font>

22
00:01:06,830 --> 00:01:09,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>and harmonize with
the flow of nature,</b></font>

23
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:12,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>you will be able to sense
Nature Energy for the first time.</b></font>

24
00:01:13,330 --> 00:01:15,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>So I just stay still?</b></font>

25
00:01:16,030 --> 00:01:18,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>That seems easy enough.</b></font>

26
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:21,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Naruto, you really don't get it, do you?</b></font>

27
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:29,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>For animals, not moving is
the hardest thing to do.</b></font>

28
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:34,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Jumping, running, molding chakra
with all my strength...</b></font>

29
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I've done those sorts of training.</b></font>

30
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:40,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>But staying still? I don't quite get it.</b></font>

31
00:01:41,270 --> 00:01:44,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>But that's how you take
in Nature Energy, right?</b></font>

32
00:01:45,330 --> 00:01:47,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>It's impossible to do it right away.</b></font>

33
00:01:47,630 --> 00:01:50,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>This training requires time,</b></font>

34
00:01:50,570 --> 00:01:52,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>since the degree of difficulty
is very high.</b></font>

35
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:55,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>It's gonna take that long?!</b></font>

36
00:01:55,530 --> 00:01:57,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Don't take it so lightly, Naruto-boy!</b></font>

37
00:01:57,970 --> 00:02:00,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Our enemy is Pain,
who possesses the Rinnegan...</b></font>

38
00:02:00,670 --> 00:02:02,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>The power of the
Sage of the Six Paths.</b></font>

39
00:02:02,570 --> 00:02:04,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>A powerful enemy
who killed Jiraiya-boy.</b></font>

40
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:09,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>With that kind of attitude,
you can't possibly win!</b></font>

41
00:02:09,930 --> 00:02:11,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I know all that!</b></font>

42
00:02:12,570 --> 00:02:15,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Pain is the leader of the Akatsuki,
who are after Tailed Beasts.</b></font>

43
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>They could come for me
at any moment.</b></font>

44
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:19,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I don't have much time to waste.</b></font>

45
00:02:24,370 --> 00:02:29,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Well, it's not as though
there isn't a better way...</b></font>

46
00:02:29,630 --> 00:02:30,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>There is?!</b></font>

47
00:02:30,700 --> 00:02:32,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Then teach me that!</b></font>

48
00:02:34,670 --> 00:02:36,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>This waterfall behind me...</b></font>

49
00:02:37,170 --> 00:02:40,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>It's the secret toad oil
of Mount Myoboku.</b></font>

50
00:02:40,330 --> 00:02:41,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Toad oil?</b></font>

51
00:02:44,130 --> 00:02:46,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Come over here and
put out your hand.</b></font>

52
00:02:54,430 --> 00:02:55,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Here.</b></font>

53
00:02:58,530 --> 00:03:03,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>This toad oil has the property
of attracting Nature Energy.</b></font>

54
00:03:03,730 --> 00:03:05,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>It helps with the training.</b></font>

55
00:03:06,230 --> 00:03:08,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Hey, that's useful!</b></font>

56
00:03:09,270 --> 00:03:12,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Whenever you rub this oil
on your body,</b></font>

57
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:15,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Nature Energy can enter
through there.</b></font>

58
00:03:16,870 --> 00:03:21,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>And gradually, you'll gain the ability
to sense Nature Energy.</b></font>

59
00:03:22,170 --> 00:03:23,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>You're right...</b></font>

60
00:03:23,330 --> 00:03:25,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I think I feel something
through my skin.</b></font>

61
00:03:26,070 --> 00:03:30,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>It is a tool to help grasp
the concept.</b></font>

62
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:34,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>In time, you won't even need
to use the oil.</b></font>

63
00:03:35,330 --> 00:03:37,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>However, there is a risk.</b></font>

64
00:03:40,670 --> 00:03:45,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>When used by one who is inexperienced
in controlling Nature Energy,</b></font>

65
00:03:45,430 --> 00:03:48,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>you start to turn into a frog.</b></font>

66
00:03:56,270 --> 00:03:58,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Wh-Wh-What the hell is this?!</b></font>

67
00:03:59,770 --> 00:04:00,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Help!</b></font>

68
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:01,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I don't wanna be a frog!</b></font>

69
00:04:04,700 --> 00:04:06,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Oww!</b></font>

70
00:04:06,930 --> 00:04:08,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>What's the big idea?</b></font>

71
00:04:09,630 --> 00:04:10,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I'm back to normal.</b></font>

72
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>It's all about balance.</b></font>

73
00:04:13,130 --> 00:04:15,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>You're used to turning your Mental
and Physical Energy</b></font>

74
00:04:15,900 --> 00:04:18,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>into ninjutsu chakra,</b></font>

75
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:20,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>so you've got a balance there.</b></font>

76
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:25,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>But now, you must add
Nature Energy into the mix.</b></font>

77
00:04:25,330 --> 00:04:27,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Getting the perfect balance
is extremely difficult.</b></font>

78
00:04:28,230 --> 00:04:29,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Balance, huh?</b></font>

79
00:04:30,100 --> 00:04:33,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>PHYSICAL     MENTAL    NATURE
Take in too little, and you won't
get Sage Jutsu chakra.</b></font>

80
00:04:33,700 --> 00:04:35,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>And yet, if you take in too much,</b></font>

81
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:39,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Nature Energy will overwhelm you
and turn you into a frog.</b></font>

82
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:45,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Of course, if you only take in
a little too much, it's reversible.</b></font>

83
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:52,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>But get beyond a certain amount,
and you'll stay as a frog,</b></font>

84
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:54,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>never reverting back to
a human again.</b></font>

85
00:04:56,730 --> 00:04:58,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>What I meant about you
having to die</b></font>

86
00:04:58,570 --> 00:05:01,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>is that you might stop being human.</b></font>

87
00:05:01,470 --> 00:05:03,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Once you turn into a frog,</b></font>

88
00:05:03,470 --> 00:05:06,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>then you progress further toward
permanently becoming one with nature.</b></font>

89
00:05:06,670 --> 00:05:10,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>And the past students
who've failed in this training...</b></font>

90
00:05:12,730 --> 00:05:14,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>are those stone statues.</b></font>

91
00:05:16,670 --> 00:05:17,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>All of them?</b></font>

92
00:05:18,870 --> 00:05:20,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Well, don't fret too much.</b></font>

93
00:05:22,700 --> 00:05:24,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>You have me.</b></font>

94
00:05:24,700 --> 00:05:29,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>And this baton beats Nature Energy
out of one's body.</b></font>

95
00:05:29,770 --> 00:05:32,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>If you start transforming into a frog,</b></font>

96
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:36,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I'll beat you thoroughly to reverse it.</b></font>

97
00:05:38,500 --> 00:05:40,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Speaking truthfully,</b></font>

98
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:44,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>even Jiraiya-boy wasn't able
to completely master this.</b></font>

99
00:05:45,870 --> 00:05:49,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>When molding Sage Jutsu chakra,</b></font>

100
00:05:49,170 --> 00:05:51,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Jiraiya-boy always acquired
some frog features.</b></font>

101
00:05:52,070 --> 00:05:54,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>But he was among the skilled ones.</b></font>

102
00:05:55,070 --> 00:05:58,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I doubt that you'd hesitate
after coming this far,</b></font>

103
00:05:58,670 --> 00:06:00,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>but let me ask you...</b></font>

104
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:03,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>What will you do?</b></font>

105
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:06,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I'll do it!</b></font>

106
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>My Ninja Way...</b></font>

107
00:06:10,100 --> 00:06:11,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>is the same as the Pervy Sage's!</b></font>

108
00:06:25,350 --> 00:06:30,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">{\an8}What did I really lose that day?</font>

109
00:06:25,350 --> 00:06:30,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">ano hi honto ni ushinatta monotte nan dattakke</font>

110
00:06:31,070 --> 00:06:36,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">{\an8}For the life of me, I can't remember.</font>

111
00:06:31,070 --> 00:06:36,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">tou ni wasureteshimatta yo</font>

112
00:06:36,910 --> 00:06:42,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">{\an8}We slowly lost sight of each other in the twilight...</font>

113
00:06:36,910 --> 00:06:42,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">yuugure de futari sukoshizutsu mienakunatteitte</font>

114
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:47,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">{\an8}And yet we're stuck here - unable to go home.</font>

115
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:47,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">sore nanoni bokura kaerezu ni ita</font>

116
00:06:47,710 --> 00:06:53,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">{\an8}Weak, frail souls lost in the world...</font>

117
00:06:47,710 --> 00:06:53,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">dokoka ni kowaresou na moroi kokoro</font>

118
00:06:53,340 --> 00:06:58,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">{\an8}We act strong to hide their fragility.</font>

119
00:06:53,340 --> 00:06:58,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">tsuyogaru kotoba de ootte kakushiteru</font>

120
00:06:58,590 --> 00:07:01,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">{\an8}Hide their fragility...</font>

121
00:06:58,590 --> 00:07:01,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">ootte kakushiteru</font>

122
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:06,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">{\an8}So farewell, but even forced apart...</font>

123
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:06,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">sayonara aenakunattatte</font>

124
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:11,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">{\an8}Our stories go on.</font>

125
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:11,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">bokura wa tsuzuki ga aru kara</font>

126
00:07:13,150 --> 00:07:19,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">{\an8}Even in a world without you, I run.</font>

127
00:07:13,150 --> 00:07:19,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">kimi no inai sekai datte hashiru yo</font>

128
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:27,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">{\an8}To someday get past the pain.</font>

129
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:27,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">itsuka no itami mo koete</font>

130
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:33,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">koete</font>

131
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:33,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="27">{\an8}Someday...</font>

132
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:45,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>The First Challenge

</i></b></font>

133
00:07:46,370 --> 00:07:48,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>We finally got the Six-Tails.</b></font>

134
00:07:49,330 --> 00:07:52,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Now we can go on the hunt
for the Nine-Tails.</b></font>

135
00:07:53,300 --> 00:07:54,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Good idea.</b></font>

136
00:07:54,670 --> 00:07:58,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Because you killed Jiraiya,
the Leaf will set their eyes on you.</b></font>

137
00:07:59,630 --> 00:08:01,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>The more time passes,</b></font>

138
00:08:01,770 --> 00:08:04,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>the more likely they'll set
some plan in motion.</b></font>

139
00:08:05,100 --> 00:08:07,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Take action before it becomes
more difficult.</b></font>

140
00:08:08,130 --> 00:08:09,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Pain is invincible...</b></font>

141
00:08:10,070 --> 00:08:13,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>No matter what happens,
we will capture the Nine-Tails.</b></font>

142
00:08:14,200 --> 00:08:16,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>There's just one more Tailed Beast left.</b></font>

143
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:17,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Not two?</b></font>

144
00:08:18,170 --> 00:08:20,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Sasuke has already captured
the Eight-Tails.</b></font>

145
00:08:20,770 --> 00:08:21,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I see.</b></font>

146
00:08:25,130 --> 00:08:27,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Konan, make preparations immediately.</b></font>

147
00:08:34,630 --> 00:08:36,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>We're heading out to the Hidden Leaf.</b></font>

148
00:08:45,630 --> 00:08:46,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Oww!</b></font>

149
00:08:48,330 --> 00:08:51,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Tomorrow, I'm going to be bruised
and bleeding on the inside.</b></font>

150
00:08:51,630 --> 00:08:54,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>What? Giving up already?</b></font>

151
00:08:55,470 --> 00:08:59,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Hey, I know a much better
training method.</b></font>

152
00:08:59,770 --> 00:09:00,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>What is it?</b></font>

153
00:09:01,170 --> 00:09:03,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Use Shadow Clones for the training.</b></font>

154
00:09:03,970 --> 00:09:06,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>They exponentially increase
my progress!</b></font>

155
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>You have a point.</b></font>

156
00:09:08,970 --> 00:09:13,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>The experience of the Shadow Clones
reverts back to the original.</b></font>

157
00:09:14,170 --> 00:09:17,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>But the reverse is also true...</b></font>

158
00:09:17,070 --> 00:09:20,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>If a Shadow Clone completely
changes into a frog,</b></font>

159
00:09:20,470 --> 00:09:22,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>it's over for the original.</b></font>

160
00:09:22,770 --> 00:09:24,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I know that already.</b></font>

161
00:09:25,070 --> 00:09:27,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Very well. But four is the limit!</b></font>

162
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:30,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Any more and neither the baton
or I can keep up!</b></font>

163
00:09:30,730 --> 00:09:31,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>All right!</b></font>

164
00:09:42,900 --> 00:09:45,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>We're not playing a game
of whack-a-mole!</b></font>

165
00:09:45,830 --> 00:09:47,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>This is training!</b></font>

166
00:09:47,230 --> 00:09:48,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I'm not gonna last doing this!</b></font>

167
00:09:49,070 --> 00:09:50,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Damn!</b></font>

168
00:09:51,500 --> 00:09:53,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Oww!</b></font>

169
00:09:54,670 --> 00:09:57,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>My face is like this from being hit!</b></font>

170
00:09:57,770 --> 00:09:59,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I'm not turning into a frog!</b></font>

171
00:09:59,700 --> 00:10:01,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>What?! Sorry.</b></font>

172
00:10:06,370 --> 00:10:09,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I never thought that training
to feel Nature Energy</b></font>

173
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:11,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>would be so hard.</b></font>

174
00:10:11,930 --> 00:10:16,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Only through perseverance shall
true strength be gained.</b></font>

175
00:10:16,730 --> 00:10:18,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I know that!</b></font>

176
00:10:18,900 --> 00:10:21,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>If it'll make me strong like
the Pervy Sage,</b></font>

177
00:10:21,300 --> 00:10:23,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>anyone would endure this.</b></font>

178
00:10:23,430 --> 00:10:25,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>No... That's impossible.</b></font>

179
00:10:26,870 --> 00:10:30,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>This training is not for everyone...</b></font>

180
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:36,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>You could say it's only possible
because it's you and Jiraiya-boy.</b></font>

181
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:39,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Or else I wouldn't have even
brought you here.</b></font>

182
00:10:40,070 --> 00:10:41,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>What do you mean?</b></font>

183
00:10:42,470 --> 00:10:46,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Unless you already possess
enormous chakra inside you,</b></font>

184
00:10:46,330 --> 00:10:50,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Nature Energy would just take
over you right away.</b></font>

185
00:10:51,830 --> 00:10:55,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>That is how intense Nature Energy is.</b></font>

186
00:10:57,230 --> 00:11:01,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Plus, they must have the guts
to never give up.</b></font>

187
00:11:01,930 --> 00:11:04,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>That's the kind of person who
can become a Sage.</b></font>

188
00:11:06,900 --> 00:11:09,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>All right! Let's do this then!</b></font>

189
00:11:10,130 --> 00:11:11,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Fool! Do you want to kill yourself?!</b></font>

190
00:11:37,470 --> 00:11:38,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I can see it!</b></font>

191
00:11:39,370 --> 00:11:42,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>- Yes!
- <i>It seems he's starting</i></b></font>

192
00:11:42,870 --> 00:11:45,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>- I can see it! I can see it!
- <i>to get the feel of Nature Energy.</i></b></font>

193
00:11:45,930 --> 00:11:49,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>- Lord Fukasaku, I'm getting a little hungry.
- I saw it! I saw it!</b></font>

194
00:11:49,670 --> 00:11:50,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>- You're right.
- I saw it!</b></font>

195
00:11:51,030 --> 00:11:53,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>- Naruto-boy, time for a break.
- I'm awesome, yeah!</b></font>

196
00:11:53,930 --> 00:11:54,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Let's eat.</b></font>

197
00:11:56,630 --> 00:11:58,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Eat up now.</b></font>

198
00:11:59,430 --> 00:12:00,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>After the break,</b></font>

199
00:12:00,930 --> 00:12:03,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I'll have you try to lift up
the stone frogs using Sage Jutsu.</b></font>

200
00:12:04,770 --> 00:12:06,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Y-Yes sir!</b></font>

201
00:12:07,670 --> 00:12:11,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Good, huh?
They're Ma's special dishes.</b></font>

202
00:12:11,700 --> 00:12:14,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>They're all favorites of mine.</b></font>

203
00:12:15,370 --> 00:12:17,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>That actually tasted quite good.</i></b></font>

204
00:12:19,670 --> 00:12:21,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>I'm becoming less human, after all.</i></b></font>

205
00:12:22,430 --> 00:12:26,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Now then, I want you to
raise the stone frog.</b></font>

206
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:30,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>But first, try it using only
your ninjutsu chakra.</b></font>

207
00:12:31,070 --> 00:12:32,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>O-Okay.</b></font>

208
00:12:36,300 --> 00:12:36,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>All right!</b></font>

209
00:12:40,930 --> 00:12:42,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I can't lift it!</b></font>

210
00:12:43,230 --> 00:12:44,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>All right, stop!</b></font>

211
00:12:49,370 --> 00:12:52,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Now, mold some Sage Jutsu chakra!</b></font>

212
00:12:52,170 --> 00:12:52,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Right!</b></font>

213
00:13:17,230 --> 00:13:20,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Good! Now try lifting
the stone frog once more!</b></font>

214
00:13:21,430 --> 00:13:22,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Okay!</b></font>

215
00:13:36,030 --> 00:13:36,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Oh!</b></font>

216
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:44,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>That's it! Naruto-boy!</b></font>

217
00:13:51,830 --> 00:13:53,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Nice, Naruto!</b></font>

218
00:13:54,130 --> 00:13:58,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>This lad's quicker on
<i>the uptake than Jiraiya-boy.</i></i></b></font>

219
00:13:58,730 --> 00:13:59,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I did it!</b></font>

220
00:13:59,900 --> 00:14:02,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Fool! How dare you treat your predecessor
with such disrespect!</b></font>

221
00:14:08,070 --> 00:14:11,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>Though he's a lot denser
<i>than Jiraiya-boy too...</i></i></b></font>

222
00:14:11,970 --> 00:14:13,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>All right, Naruto-boy!</b></font>

223
00:14:13,370 --> 00:14:16,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Now put all the toppled stones
back in place!</b></font>

224
00:14:16,230 --> 00:14:18,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Are you serious?!</b></font>

225
00:14:28,870 --> 00:14:30,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>The Eight-Tails, huh?</b></font>

226
00:14:31,170 --> 00:14:34,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>It seems Sasuke was successful.</b></font>

227
00:14:35,270 --> 00:14:37,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Pain will bring the Nine-Tails.</b></font>

228
00:14:41,030 --> 00:14:45,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>It appears you've mastered
toad oil assisted control.</b></font>

229
00:14:46,170 --> 00:14:49,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Now you need to master
controlling Nature Energy</b></font>

230
00:14:49,170 --> 00:14:51,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>without using the oil.</b></font>

231
00:14:55,630 --> 00:14:57,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I can feel the power flowing into me!</b></font>

232
00:14:58,630 --> 00:15:03,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Ninjutsu chakra consumes
your internal energy.</b></font>

233
00:15:03,030 --> 00:15:05,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>The more you use it,
the more exhausted you will become.</b></font>

234
00:15:06,770 --> 00:15:10,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>In contrast, Sage Jutsu chakra
draws in external energy,</b></font>

235
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:12,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>so it will not tire you.</b></font>

236
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:15,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>In fact, you will recover and
heal quicker too.</b></font>

237
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I get it...</b></font>

238
00:15:18,430 --> 00:15:21,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>Well... With the Nine-Tails' chakra
<i>in the mix too,</i></i></b></font>

239
00:15:21,700 --> 00:15:23,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>he's showing a truly remarkable
<i>recovery rate.</i></i></b></font>

240
00:15:25,470 --> 00:15:28,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Now maybe I can do that too...</b></font>

241
00:15:29,130 --> 00:15:29,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Do what?</b></font>

242
00:15:29,970 --> 00:15:31,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Huh?! Oh, nothing...</b></font>

243
00:15:31,770 --> 00:15:32,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Nothing at all!</b></font>

244
00:15:33,170 --> 00:15:36,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Never mind then... But here.</b></font>

245
00:15:37,130 --> 00:15:40,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I thought I'd give you
this today, Naruto-boy.</b></font>

246
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:42,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>What is it?</b></font>

247
00:15:42,570 --> 00:15:43,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>A book.</b></font>

248
00:15:43,800 --> 00:15:44,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Book?</b></font>

249
00:15:45,030 --> 00:15:48,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>This is the first novel
Jiraiya-boy wrote.</b></font>

250
00:15:49,530 --> 00:15:52,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>A lot of Jiraiya-boy's mind and
heart are contained within it.</b></font>

251
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:54,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>You should read it.</b></font>

252
00:16:00,730 --> 00:16:03,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>TALES OF A GUTSY NINJA
Tales of...a Gutsy Ninja.</b></font>

253
00:16:07,430 --> 00:16:09,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Why don't you give it up?</b></font>

254
00:16:14,370 --> 00:16:17,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>This game of tag is getting boring.</b></font>

255
00:16:31,470 --> 00:16:32,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Give it up.</b></font>

256
00:16:33,030 --> 00:16:34,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Can I say one thing?</b></font>

257
00:16:34,470 --> 00:16:35,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I don't care to listen!</b></font>

258
00:16:37,130 --> 00:16:38,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Die already!</b></font>

259
00:16:38,830 --> 00:16:40,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Give up...</b></font>

260
00:16:43,400 --> 00:16:44,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>on me giving up!</b></font>

261
00:16:47,900 --> 00:16:50,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Even if you bring me down,</b></font>

262
00:16:50,130 --> 00:16:54,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>another assassin will attack
the village...</b></font>

263
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:01,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>As long as we are cursed to
live in this Ninja World,</b></font>

264
00:17:01,770 --> 00:17:03,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>there will be no peace.</b></font>

265
00:17:06,670 --> 00:17:08,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Then...I'll break that curse!</b></font>

266
00:17:09,270 --> 00:17:13,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>If there is such a thing as peace,
I'll seize it!</b></font>

267
00:17:13,630 --> 00:17:15,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I'll never give up!</b></font>

268
00:17:17,530 --> 00:17:20,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Wh-Who are you...?</b></font>

269
00:17:21,370 --> 00:17:22,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>My name is...</b></font>

270
00:17:23,070 --> 00:17:26,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>TALES OF A GUTSY NINJA</b></font>

271
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:35,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>JIRAIYA</b></font>

272
00:17:43,970 --> 00:17:47,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>Sasuke said he was going to
<i>sever his bond with me</i></i></b></font>

273
00:17:47,530 --> 00:17:48,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>and become stronger.</i></b></font>

274
00:17:49,570 --> 00:17:52,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>He said I could never understand
<i>his feelings.</i></i></b></font>

275
00:17:56,500 --> 00:18:00,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>You were friends with Orochimaru
<i>long ago, right, Pervy Sage?</i></i></b></font>

276
00:18:00,730 --> 00:18:03,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>Why did Orochimaru desert
<i>the village</i></i></b></font>

277
00:18:03,370 --> 00:18:05,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>and decide to destroy the Hidden Leaf?</i></b></font>

278
00:18:06,970 --> 00:18:11,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>Orochimaru changed after
<i>his parents were killed.</i></i></b></font>

279
00:18:12,030 --> 00:18:15,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>He became obsessed with
<i>the Forbidden Jutsu.</i></i></b></font>

280
00:18:16,530 --> 00:18:19,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>Maybe he longed to see his parents...</i></b></font>

281
00:18:19,500 --> 00:18:21,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>Or he sought revenge
<i>on the Leaf Village,</i></i></b></font>

282
00:18:21,470 --> 00:18:23,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>who he held responsible
<i>for their deaths.</i></i></b></font>

283
00:18:24,330 --> 00:18:27,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>My parents weren't killed.</i></b></font>

284
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:30,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>So like you,</i></b></font>

285
00:18:30,300 --> 00:18:34,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>I was accused of not being
<i>able to understand.</i></i></b></font>

286
00:18:34,770 --> 00:18:36,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>Perhaps he was right,</i></b></font>

287
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:39,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>and I didn't understand a thing about him...</i></b></font>

288
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:45,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>However...</i></b></font>

289
00:18:46,470 --> 00:18:51,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>Even I can see there's too much hate
<i>in our Ninja World.</i></i></b></font>

290
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:53,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>Hate?</i></b></font>

291
00:18:54,370 --> 00:18:57,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>And I've wanted to do something
<i>about this hatred,</i></i></b></font>

292
00:18:58,070 --> 00:19:01,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>yet I'm not sure what must be done.</i></b></font>

293
00:19:01,870 --> 00:19:03,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>But I have faith...</i></b></font>

294
00:19:03,870 --> 00:19:06,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>that there will come a time</i></b></font>

295
00:19:06,130 --> 00:19:08,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>when people can truly understand
<i>one another.</i></i></b></font>

296
00:19:10,070 --> 00:19:12,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>It all sounds kinda complicated.</i></b></font>

297
00:19:12,970 --> 00:19:15,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>And if I can't find the answer,</i></b></font>

298
00:19:15,370 --> 00:19:18,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>perhaps I will entrust you to find it.</i></b></font>

299
00:19:18,970 --> 00:19:22,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>Yes, sir! I can't turn you down,
<i>can I, Pervy Sage?</i></i></b></font>

300
00:19:24,770 --> 00:19:27,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>What? Why are you laughing?</i></b></font>

301
00:19:27,730 --> 00:19:30,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>Your smile is my salvation.</i></b></font>

302
00:19:33,170 --> 00:19:35,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>I'm glad I made you my student.</i></b></font>

303
00:19:35,830 --> 00:19:37,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>R-Really?</i></b></font>

304
00:19:38,430 --> 00:19:41,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>But I haven't given up yet.</i></b></font>

305
00:19:42,730 --> 00:19:46,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>PRODUCTION NOTEBOOK
<i>I plan to change this world
<i>with my books!</i></i></b></font>

306
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:49,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>With those books that don't sell?</i></b></font>

307
00:19:49,270 --> 00:19:50,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>You fool!</i></b></font>

308
00:19:50,700 --> 00:19:52,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>They'll be bestsellers before
<i>you know it!</i></i></b></font>

309
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:54,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>And when that day finally arrives,</i></b></font>

310
00:19:54,170 --> 00:19:56,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>I won't autograph your copies
<i>even if you beg me!</i></i></b></font>

311
00:19:56,230 --> 00:19:57,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b><i>I don't need any of that!</i></b></font>

312
00:20:01,070 --> 00:20:02,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I don't need any of that...</b></font>

313
00:20:06,400 --> 00:20:11,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>'Cuz Pervy Sage... You gave me
something much more valuable.</b></font>

314
00:20:28,200 --> 00:20:31,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>With so few people,
it sure is taking a while.</b></font>

315
00:20:31,730 --> 00:20:32,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Shut up!</b></font>

316
00:20:32,930 --> 00:20:34,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Be quiet and focus.</b></font>

317
00:20:47,900 --> 00:20:49,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>It appears...</b></font>

318
00:20:49,530 --> 00:20:51,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Sasuke has blundered.</b></font>

319
00:20:57,370 --> 00:20:59,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>An octopus leg!</b></font>

320
00:20:59,600 --> 00:21:00,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Quit laughing!</b></font>

321
00:22:36,730 --> 00:22:38,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>What's this sensation?

</b></font>

322
00:22:39,270 --> 00:22:41,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I don't feel uncomfortable
being still at all!

</b></font>

323
00:22:42,470 --> 00:22:45,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Is this what it feels like to become
one with nature?

</b></font>

324
00:22:46,430 --> 00:22:48,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I'm not using the toad oil,

</b></font>

325
00:22:48,370 --> 00:22:50,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>but I can tell power is being gathered
from everywhere!

</b></font>

326
00:22:51,600 --> 00:22:55,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>I can feel the power surging
inside of me!

</b></font>

327
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:59,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Is this Sage Mode?!

</b></font>

328
00:23:00,330 --> 00:23:03,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Next time on Naruto Shippuden:
"Surpassing the Master"

</b></font>

329
00:23:04,770 --> 00:23:08,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="26"><b>Tune in again!

